cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article below."
title: "SecureSDP"
abstract: >-
  Go implementation of SecureSDP, a Software-Defined Perimeter organized after
  the Bridge model (root and bridged controllers, mutual TLS, fwknop Single
  Packet Authorization) with dynamic hardening of accepting hosts through
  Egida. Written in 2026 following the architecture described in the article.
